          "title": "You'll want to know: నెమ్మదిగా",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నెమ్మదిగా (nemmadigā) — \"slowly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నెమ్మదిగా (nemmadigā) మాట్లాడండి — \"please speak slowly\". You have the verb from your first chapters and the polite ending from raṇḍi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Notice the -గా at the end: the same ending that made alasaṭagā and caligā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The request a beginner needs most."
            }
          ]
        },
